"{\"direction\":\"source_to_graph\",\"findings\":[{\"id\":\"finding_1\",\"status\":\"represented\",\"statement\":\"整体目标：使用凭据门控的首选工具与有界归档回退来获取一个 source。\",\"explanation\":\"原文第3行给出总体目标。图中以 source_id 驱动单一 source，block_003 以 FAST_KEY 是否存在作为门控，block_004 调用 fast.fetch，block_007/block_008 限制一次重试，block_011 调用 archive.fetch 且其约束声明最多一次，block_014 处理归档失败并返回错误。整体结构保留了凭据门控首选工具与有界归档回退。\",\"source_refs\":[{\"file\":\"SKILL.md\",\"start_line\":3,\"end_line\":3,\"quote\":\"description: Fetch one source using a credential-gated preferred tool and a bounded archive fallback.\"}],\"graph_refs\":[\"/entry_block_id\",\"/blocks/block_003/constraints/0\",\"/blocks/block_004/instructions/0\",\"/blocks/block_007/instructions/0\",\"/blocks/block_008/instructions/0\",\"/blocks/block_011/instructions/0\",\"/blocks/block_011/constraints/1\",\"/blocks/block_014/instructions/1\"],\"text_refs\":[],\"requirement_ids\":[\"req_1\"],\"basis\":[\"explicit_graph\",\"declared_constraint\"],\"unknown_reason\":null},{\"id\":\"finding_2\",\"status\":\"represented\",\"statement\":\"从用户请求读取 source_id，并从环境读取 FAST_KEY。\",\"explanation\":\"block_001 的 ir_001 以 context_key source_id 读取用户请求并输出 result_001；block_002 的 ir_003 以 context_key FAST_KEY 读取环境并输出 result_002。两条 dispatch 和边 block_001→block_002→block_003 表示先读取再进入后续判断。\",\"source_refs\":[{\"file\":\"SKILL.md\",\"start_line\":8,\"end_line\":8,\"quote\":\"1. Read source_id from the user's request and read FAST_KEY from the environment.\"}],\"graph_refs\":[\"/blocks/block_001/instructions/0\",\"/blocks/block_002/instructions/0\",\"/edges/0\",\"/edges/1\"],\"text_refs\":[],\"requirement_ids\":[\"req_2\"],\"basis\":[\"explicit_graph\"],\"unknown_reason\":null},{\"id\":\"finding_3\",\"status\":\"represented\",\"statement\":\"若 FAST_KEY 存在，则先调用 fast.fetch 并传入 source_id 与 FAST_KEY；若不存在，则直接 archive.fetch 且不调用 fast.fetch。\",\"explanation\":\"block_003 约束与原文一致，ir_005 检查 result_002 得到 result_003；边 block_003→block_004 条件为 FAST_KEY is present，边 block_003→block_011 条件为 FAST_KEY is absent。block_004 调用 fast.fetch，输入 result_001 和 result_002；absent 路径直接进入 block_011，图中没有经过 fast.fetch 调用块。\",\"source_refs\":[{\"file\":\"SKILL.md\",\"start_line\":9,\"end_line\":9,\"quote\":\"2. If FAST_KEY is present, try fast.fetch first with source_id and FAST_KEY; if it is absent, go directly to archive.fetch without calling fast.fetch.\"}],\"graph_refs\":[\"/blocks/block_003/constraints/0\",\"/edges/2\",\"/edges/3\",\"/blocks/block_004/instructions/0\",\"/blocks/block_011/instructions/0\"],\"text_refs\":[],\"requirement_ids\":[\"req_3\"],\"basis\":[\"explicit_graph\",\"declared_constraint\"],\"unknown_reason\":null},{\"id\":\"finding_4\",\"status\":\"represented\",\"statement\":\"仅当 fast.fetch 第一次尝试以 transient error 失败时恰好重试一次；非 transient 首次失败不得重试。\",\"explanation\":\"block_007 的 ir_013 基于 result_005 检查 transient error；transient 边到 block_008，non-transient 边到 block_011。block_008 的重试操作带约束明确 exactly once 且不得重试 non-transient；图中没有回到重试块形成多次重试的边。\",\"source_refs\":[{\"file\":\"SKILL.md\",\"start_line\":10,\"end_line\":10,\"quote\":\"3. Retry fast.fetch exactly once only when its first attempt fails with a transient error; do not retry a non-transient first failure.\"}],\"graph_refs\":[\"/blocks/block_007/instructions/0\",\"/edges/7\",\"/edges/8\",\"/blocks/block_008/instructions/0\",\"/blocks/block_008/instructions/0/constraints/0\"],\"text_refs\":[],\"requirement_ids\":[\"req_4\"],\"basis\":[\"explicit_graph\",\"declared_constraint\"],\"unknown_reason\":null},{\"id\":\"finding_5\",\"status\":\"represented\",\"statement\":\"非 transient 首次失败或 fast.fetch 重试失败后，调用 archive.fetch 并传入 source_id。\",\"explanation\":\"block_007 的 non-transient 边指向 block_011，block_009 的 retry failed 边也指向 block_011。block_011 的约束重述该条件，ir_021 调用 archive.fetch 并输入 result_001。\",\"source_refs\":[{\"file\":\"SKILL.md\",\"start_line\":11,\"end_line\":11,\"quote\":\"4. After a non-transient first failure or any failed retry of fast.fetch, call archive.fetch with source_id.\"}],\"graph_refs\":[\"/edges/8\",\"/edges/11\",\"/blocks/block_011/constraints/0\",\"/blocks/block_011/instructions/0\"],\"text_refs\":[],\"requirement_ids\":[\"req_5\"],\"basis\":[\"explicit_graph\",\"declared_constraint\"],\"unknown_reason\":null},{\"id\":\"finding_6\",\"status\":\"represented\",\"statement\":\"archive.fetch 最多调用一次，且只传 source_id 作为参数。\",\"explanation\":\"图中只有一个 call_archive_fetch 指令 ir_021，且 block_011 约束声明 at most once 和 only argument。ir_021 的输入除外部资源 archive.fetch 外仅为 result_001（source_id 结果），未包含 FAST_KEY 或其他业务参数。\",\"source_refs\":[{\"file\":\"SKILL.md\",\"start_line\":12,\"end_line\":12,\"quote\":\"5. Call archive.fetch at most once and pass source_id as its only argument.\"}],\"graph_refs\":[\"/blocks/block_011/constraints/1\",\"/blocks/block_011/instructions/0\"],\"text_refs\":[],\"requirement_ids\":[\"req_6\"],\"basis\":[\"explicit_graph\",\"declared_constraint\"],\"unknown_reason\":null},{\"id\":\"finding_7\",\"status\":\"represented\",\"statement\":\"任一工具成功时返回该成功响应的 body 值且不改变，并不再发起 fetch 调用。\",\"explanation\":\"原文第13行。图中首次 fast.fetch 成功经 edge 5 到 block_006 返回 result_004；重试成功经 edge 10 到 block_010 返回 result_008；archive.fetch 成功经 edge 13 到 block_013 返回 result_011。返回指令没有变换输入，且 return 为结构终结，相关块无后续出边，故成功路径无进一步 fetch 调用。\",\"source_refs\":[{\"file\":\"SKILL.md\",\"start_line\":13,\"end_line\":13,\"quote\":\"6. On either tool's success, return that successful response's body value unchanged and make no further fetch calls.\"}],\"graph_refs\":[\"/constraints/2\",\"/edges/5\",\"/edges/10\",\"/edges/13\",\"/blocks/block_006/instructions/1\",\"/blocks/block_010/instructions/1\",\"/blocks/block_013/instructions/1\"],\"text_refs\":[],\"requirement_ids\":[\"req_7\"],\"basis\":[\"explicit_graph\",\"declared_constraint\"],\"unknown_reason\":null},{\"id\":\"finding_8\",\"status\":\"represented\",\"statement\":\"若 archive.fetch 失败，则停止并返回其错误；不得重试 archive.fetch。\",\"explanation\":\"block_012 的 archive.fetch failed 边指向 block_014；block_014 的 return 使用 result_012（archive_fetch_error）。block_014 无出边，且 block_011 约束明确 archive.fetch 失败时停止返回错误且不重试。\",\"source_refs\":[{\"file\":\"SKILL.md\",\"start_line\":14,\"end_line\":14,\"quote\":\"7. If archive.fetch fails, stop and return its error; do not retry archive.fetch.\"}],\"graph_refs\":[\"/edges/14\",\"/blocks/block_014/instructions/1\",\"/blocks/block_011/constraints/2\"],\"text_refs\":[],\"requirement_ids\":[\"req_8\"],\"basis\":[\"explicit_graph\",\"declared_constraint\"],\"unknown_reason\":null},{\"id\":\"finding_9\",\"status\":\"represented\",\"statement\":\"整个工作流绝不把 FAST_KEY 传给 archive.fetch 或 diagnostic output。\",\"explanation\":\"全局约束第0条重述该禁令；archive.fetch 调用 ir_021 的输入只有 archive.fetch 外部资源和 result_001，没有 result_002/FAST_KEY。图中未出现 diagnostic output 业务操作，也没有把 FAST_KEY 传给此类输出的指令。\",\"source_refs\":[{\"file\":\"SKILL.md\",\"start_line\":15,\"end_line\":15,\"quote\":\"8. Never pass FAST_KEY to archive.fetch or diagnostic output anywhere in this workflow.\"}],\"graph_refs\":[\"/constraints/0\",\"/blocks/block_011/instructions/0\"],\"text_refs\":[],\"requirement_ids\":[\"req_9\"],\"basis\":[\"declared_constraint\",\"explicit_graph\"],\"unknown_reason\":null},{\"id\":\"finding_10\",\"status\":\"represented\",\"statement\":\"在每一条成功或失败返回路径返回之前，将最终状态追加到本地 status.txt。\",\"explanation\":\"全局约束第1条重述要求。四条 return 路径的块内顺序均为先 append_final_status_to_status_file，再 return：block_006、block_010、block_013 追加 success，block_014 追加 failure；所有 return 指令前都有对应 append 指令。\",\"source_refs\":[{\"file\":\"SKILL.md\",\"start_line\":16,\"end_line\":16,\"quote\":\"9. Before returning from every success or failure path, append the final status to local status.txt.\"}],\"graph_refs\":[\"/constraints/1\",\"/blocks/block_006/instructions/0\",\"/blocks/block_006/instructions/1\",\"/blocks/block_010/instructions/0\",\"/blocks/block_010/instructions/1\",\"/blocks/block_013/instructions/0\",\"/blocks/block_013/instructions/1\",\"/blocks/block_014/instructions/0\",\"/blocks/block_014/instructions/1\"],\"text_refs\":[],\"requirement_ids\":[\"req_10\"],\"basis\":[\"declared_constraint\",\"explicit_graph\"],\"unknown_reason\":null},{\"id\":\"finding_11\",\"status\":\"unsupported_addition\",\"statement\":\"图中 block_007 在判断 transient 后、分支前加入 wait_for_seconds(2)。\",\"explanation\":\"该等待操作及其约束“Wait for 2 seconds before continuing.”在第10-11行的重试/回退原文中没有对应要求；检索全文也没有 2 秒等待或退避语义。它会在首次失败后执行，且因位于 dispatch 之前，transient 与非 transient 路径都会先等待，属于无原文依据的新增行为。\",\"source_refs\":[{\"file\":\"SKILL.md\",\"start_line\":10,\"end_line\":10,\"quote\":\"3. Retry fast.fetch exactly once only when its first attempt fails with a transient error; do not retry a non-transient first failure.\"},{\"file\":\"SKILL.md\",\"start_line\":11,\"end_line\":11,\"quote\":\"4. After a non-transient first failure or any failed retry of fast.fetch, call archive.fetch with source_id.\"}],\"graph_refs\":[\"/blocks/block_007/instructions/1\",\"/blocks/block_007/instructions/1/constraints/0\"],\"text_refs\":[],\"requirement_ids\":[],\"basis\":[\"explicit_graph\",\"insufficient\"],\"unknown_reason\":null},{\"id\":\"finding_12\",\"status\":\"unsupported_addition\",\"statement\":\"图中把追加到 status.txt 的最终状态具体写为字面值“success”或“failure”。\",\"explanation\":\"原文第16行只要求追加“最终状态”，未规定状态字段的字面值或编码。图中成功路径的 append 指令写入 literal_value“success”，archive 失败路径写入 literal_value“failure”。这些具体状态字符串在原文中没有显式来源，属于新增的字面值内容。\",\"source_refs\":[{\"file\":\"SKILL.md\",\"start_line\":16,\"end_line\":16,\"quote\":\"9. Before returning from every success or failure path, append the final status to local status.txt.\"}],\"graph_refs\":[\"/blocks/block_006/instructions/0/inputs/1/literal_value\",\"/blocks/block_010/instructions/0/inputs/1/literal_value\",\"/blocks/block_013/instructions/0/inputs/1/literal_value\",\"/blocks/block_014/instructions/0/inputs/1/literal_value\"],\"text_refs\":[],\"requirement_ids\":[],\"basis\":[\"explicit_graph\",\"insufficient\"],\"unknown_reason\":null}],\"reviewed_requirement_ids\":[\"req_1\",\"req_2\",\"req_3\",\"req_4\",\"req_5\",\"req_6\",\"req_7\",\"req_8\",\"req_9\",\"req_10\"],\"reviewed_unit_ids\":[],\"reviewed_instruction_ids\":[\"ir_001\",\"ir_002\",\"ir_003\",\"ir_004\",\"ir_005\",\"ir_006\",\"ir_007\",\"ir_008\",\"ir_009\",\"ir_010\",\"ir_011\",\"ir_012\",\"ir_013\",\"ir_wait_1\",\"ir_014\",\"ir_015\",\"ir_016\",\"ir_017\",\"ir_018\",\"ir_019\",\"ir_020\",\"ir_021\",\"ir_022\",\"ir_023\",\"ir_024\",\"ir_025\",\"ir_026\",\"ir_027\",\"ir_028\"],\"notes\":[\"已完成 source_to_graph 双向核对；所有候选 requirement id 均在 findings.requirement_ids 中明确覆盖。\",\"已列出当前图全部 29 条指令 id；未使用文本单元，reviewed_unit_ids 与各 finding 的 text_refs 均为空。\"]}"
